1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 24=

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:09,879
Why?

16
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,840
Why?

17
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:14,120
Why have I worked so hard,

18
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,920
only to end up ignored by everyone?

19
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:19,599
Why do I even cultivate?

20
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,920
What do I truly want?

21
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:30,640
(Take this,)

22
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,200
(I made it myself.)

23
00:01:32,359 --> 00:01:33,120
(It's for you.)

24
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:34,719
(It's really good.)

25
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,640
(Just take it.)

26
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:53,599
Zhao Feiyang.

27
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:56,519
I'm in this mess because of you.

28
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,560
Why do you always block my path?

29
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:02,439
Why can I never catch up to you?

30
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,040
This pointless cultivation...

31
00:02:06,359 --> 00:02:08,400
Should I really keep going?

32
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,479
(Of course you should.)

33
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,560
Who?

34
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:17,120
Who are you?

35
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:20,599
(Xuan Ming, Lord of Nether Hall)
I am Xuan Ming, Lord of Nether Hall.

36
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,280
Lord of Nether Hall?

37
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:24,120
An evil sect member must die.

38
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:27,360
You have some courage.

39
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,199
What exactly do you want to do?

40
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,840
Do you want to grow stronger?

41
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:32,520
I...

42
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:34,240
Do you want the world to see you?

43
00:02:34,599 --> 00:02:37,560
And make those who scorned you
regret it?

44
00:02:38,759 --> 00:02:39,520
Yes.

45
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,400
Become my disciple.

46
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,280
I'll never join an evil sect.

47
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,280
Forget it.

48
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:49,800
Just kill me.

49
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,199
How naive.

50
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:52,639
What makes a sect evil?

51
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:55,479
Where do you draw the line
between good and evil?

52
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,199
In this world,

53
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:59,360
the strong define everything.

54
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:00,360
The weak

55
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,159
are worth less than animals.

56
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,479
What do you see in me?

57
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,319
Your cultivation art.

58
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,599
My cultivation art?

59
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,479
Mine is the lowest grade,

60
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:14,080
the ordinary Primordial Dao Art.

61
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,680
Could the Primordial Dao Art

62
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,520
really take you in just over a year

63
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:21,240
from Body Tempering Realm, Stage 1
to the Minor Perfection Realm?

64
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:24,520
I have an innate divine-grade Dao Bone.

65
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,719
Even that is far from enough.

66
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:28,680
Then my cultivation art is...

67
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,000
The Nine Heavens Codex.

68
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:32,800
What?

69
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:36,360
The Nine Heavens Codex, said to surpass
heaven-tier cultivation arts?

70
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:37,759
Correct.

71
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,639
How else could you cultivate

72
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:42,639
at such incredible speed?

73
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,719
But Zhao Feiyang taught me the...

74
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,120
Yes.

75
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,360
Because he cultivates

76
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,560
the Nine Heavens Codex.

77
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:54,639
This art requires the right opportunity.

78
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,319
Without the right opportunity,

79
00:03:57,759 --> 00:04:00,759
it's no better than the lowest-grade
Primordial Dao Art.

80
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,960
But with the right opportunity,

81
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:06,719
it becomes a sacred-tier cultivation art
surpassing heaven-tier cultivation arts.

82
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,199
The facts prove

83
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,120
you have the right opportunity.

84
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,000
Zhao Feiyang

85
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:13,840
gave me the Nine Heavens Codex
by accident.

86
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,560
The Nine Heavens Codex

87
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,360
is unique to Nether Hall.

88
00:04:18,759 --> 00:04:20,480
Unfortunately, for many years,

89
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:23,480
no one with the right opportunity
could fully comprehend it.

90
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:25,240
Since you learned it,

91
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:27,439
fate has bound you to Nether Hall.

92
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:29,839
Becoming my disciple now

93
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:32,879
is only natural.

94
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:42,800
Greetings, Master.

95
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,519
A wise choice.

96
00:04:46,690 --> 00:04:50,550
(Auspicious Omens)

97
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,199
Zhao Feiyang.

98
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,639
You're too arrogant.

99
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:54,199
I'll kill you today.

100
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,920
What is the meaning of this?

101
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:58,279
At this point,

102
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,360
killing him won't help us.

103
00:05:01,079 --> 00:05:02,720
We must retrieve the resources first.

104
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:03,759
Otherwise,

105
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:06,720
the Three Great Sects
will exist in name only.

106
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,319
Right.

107
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,600
First, make him tell us
where the resources are.

108
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:09,839
Then we can kill him.

109
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,800
Zhao Feiyang.

110
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,720
If you hand over all the resources,

111
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:14,480
we'll spare your life.

112
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,920
I've absorbed them all.

113
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:18,519
To get them back,

114
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,079
you'll have to kill me.

115
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,120
Arrogant.

116
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,040
You're only flesh and blood.

117
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:25,879
How could your body contain
so much spiritual energy?

118
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,639
You must have converted and hidden it.

119
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:36,959
Good heavens.

120
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:38,480
He crystallized qi.

121
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,720
How much spiritual energy

122
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,439
is he hiding inside his body?

123
00:05:42,279 --> 00:05:43,480
Can a human even do that?

124
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:44,800
(Zhao Feiyang.)

125
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,800
(What happened to you?)

126
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:49,879
Do you believe me now?

127
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,680
Looks like we really can't kill him.

128
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:52,959
If he dies,

129
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:54,319
the spiritual energy will disperse.

130
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,879
Then we're truly finished.

131
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,759
No wonder he's so fearless.

132
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,399
That was his leverage.

133
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,480
Darn.

134
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,319
Zhao Feiyang.

135
00:06:02,759 --> 00:06:03,959
What exactly do you want to do?

136
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:06,240
Do you know why Shenwu Continent has

137
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:09,480
three great powers
in the east, west, and north,

138
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:11,639
but none in the Southern Domain?

139
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,560
Everyone knows

140
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,879
the Southern Domain
lacks spiritual energy.

141
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:15,720
Yes.

142
00:06:16,199 --> 00:06:18,439
Any cultivator who grows strong here

143
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,879
eventually leaves for one of
the other three domains.

144
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,959
That isn't what matters.

145
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:24,240
What matters is that
the Southern Domain isn't united.

146
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:25,879
It needs a leader.

147
00:06:26,759 --> 00:06:27,480
What do you mean?

148
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:29,480
Today, I offer you a chance.

149
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,399
Submit to me.

150
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:32,959
From this day on,

151
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:34,839
the Southern Domain will unite.

152
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:37,439
Only then will we be strong enough

153
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,600
to challenge the other domains.

154
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,720
From now on, the disciples' cultivation

155
00:06:41,959 --> 00:06:42,879
and all sect expenses

156
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:44,720
will be my responsibility.

157
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,319
I'll keep everything running.

158
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:47,879
Can you truly provide for

159
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:50,560
our sect's future spirit vein needs?

160
00:06:50,639 --> 00:06:52,800
Spiritual energy is fading daily.

161
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,360
We already planned to merge

162
00:06:55,199 --> 00:06:56,199
so we could survive together.

163
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:58,839
Now the new spirit vein is destroyed.

164
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:02,000
If someone bears the burden now,

165
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,120
we could accept that.

166
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,959
Can you really do it?

167
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:09,079
My word is my bond.

168
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,279
(No way.)

169
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,959
(Zhao Feiyang is about to become
Lord of the Southern Domain.)

170
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,120
Zhao Feiyang.

171
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,519
You think you can

172
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:17,120
rise to power in the Southern Domain?

173
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,480
Let me tell you.

174
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:20,839
In your dreams.

175
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,560
If I'm right,

176
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,360
you have a feud with Nether Hall.

177
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,959
You want to use us

178
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,800
as your weapons against them.

179
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,240
That is part of my plan.

180
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:30,600
Everyone.

181
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:31,959
You heard him.

182
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,519
This brat has planned it all.

183
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:36,600
Don't let him deceive you.

184
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,199
You offer nothing

185
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,720
yet expect all the rewards.

186
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,199
You think that's possible?

187
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,279
Sect Master.

188
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,600
You saw that too.

189
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,439
There's nothing to discuss
with this kid.

190
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,000
Let me subdue him first.

191
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:50,000
Then we'll find a way

192
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:51,720
to extract his spiritual energy.

193
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:55,839
Sect Master, let me fight him.

194
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:57,000
No.

195
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:59,079
Even Cuihua lost to him.

196
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,519
He had the precious
Heavenly Mystic Robe then.

197
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:05,319
Now I possess the robe.

198
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:06,920
He cannot break my defense.

199
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,920
I have the advantage.

200
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:10,560
I'll subdue him in a few moves.

201
00:08:10,959 --> 00:08:11,480
Go.

202
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,079
Do not kill him.

203
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:13,639
Yes.

204
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:22,759
Zhao Feiyang.

205
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,879
For the shame you caused me,

206
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,920
I'll pay you back

207
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:30,279
tenfold, a hundredfold.

208
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,159
What?

209
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,279
This...

210
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,800
(Virtue Shines Through)

211
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,200
My Heavenly Mystic Robe.

212
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,240
My Heavenly Mystic Robe!

213
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,399
It's a top-grade magic treasure,

214
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:19,000
immune to fire and water.

215
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:19,600
It...

216
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:21,960
It broke just like that?

217
00:09:27,639 --> 00:09:28,159
No.

218
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,000
(Virtue Shines Through)

219
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,120
Zhao Feiyang, you...

220
00:09:50,759 --> 00:09:52,240
I'm sorry, Elder Murong.

221
00:09:54,279 --> 00:09:56,360
I never intended to kill him.

222
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,720
But he tried to kill me.

223
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:04,080
(Looks like Zhao Feiyang wasn't lying.)

224
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:05,840
(He truly killed Jiang Cheng.)

225
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:08,480
(When did he become so strong?)

226
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,639
What's going on?

227
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:11,440
Are my eyes deceiving me?

228
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,879
The dead man's spiritual energy

229
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,759
all entered Zhao Feiyang's body.

230
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:16,919
What evil art is this?

231
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,120
Could it be...

232
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:18,919
Could he be...

233
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:21,799
He is the legendary one destined
to trigger the great tribulation.

234
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,639
Could the great tribulation
really exist?

235
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,240
If that is true,

236
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,519
even if we give up these resources,

237
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:30,679
we cannot let him unleash this disaster.

238
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,399
Are they about to fight again?

239
00:10:35,039 --> 00:10:36,639
For all living beings...

240
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:38,879
Everyone.

241
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,000
Is there some misunderstanding?

242
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,600
There is no misunderstanding.

243
00:10:44,519 --> 00:10:45,120
Holy Maiden.

244
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,159
We have to do this.

245
00:10:47,639 --> 00:10:48,759
And so do you.

246
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,480
If you won't join us,

247
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:52,039
please leave first.

248
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,039
Otherwise,

249
00:10:53,639 --> 00:10:55,639
we won't make an exception for anyone.

250
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,360
Zhao Feiyang.

251
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,399
You should never have

252
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:11,879
chosen a path to your own ruin.

253
00:11:12,519 --> 00:11:13,799
There is nothing I can do.

254
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,200
You're on your own.

255
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,879
When you withdrew from the sect,

256
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,399
you took three lashes.

257
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,799
I held back my spiritual power then.

258
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,000
But today,

259
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:33,600
I'll use all my strength

260
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:35,960
and make you suffer excruciating pain
before you die.

261
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:48,399
That's it?

262
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,480
I felt nothing.

263
00:11:50,679 --> 00:11:51,240
What?

264
00:11:51,759 --> 00:11:54,559
How could you feel nothing?

265
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,440
No way.

266
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:03,919
Are you done?

267
00:12:09,679 --> 00:12:10,200
Elder Wang!

268
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:25,440
Elder Wang!

269
00:12:25,759 --> 00:12:26,320
Elder Wang!

270
00:12:45,039 --> 00:12:47,039
Minor Perfection Realm, Stage 7,

271
00:12:47,799 --> 00:12:48,960
feels pretty good.

272
00:12:55,856 --> 00:12:59,486
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

273
00:12:59,643 --> 00:13:02,313
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

274
00:13:02,573 --> 00:13:06,123
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

275
00:13:06,303 --> 00:13:10,503
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

276
00:13:10,953 --> 00:13:14,203
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

277
00:13:14,573 --> 00:13:17,383
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

278
00:13:17,693 --> 00:13:21,073
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

279
00:13:21,203 --> 00:13:25,433
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

280
00:13:25,873 --> 00:13:29,003
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

281
00:13:29,293 --> 00:13:32,373
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

282
00:13:32,943 --> 00:13:35,783
♪With this flesh and soul♪

283
00:13:36,013 --> 00:13:39,033
♪I shall forge a new age♪

284
00:13:39,370 --> 00:13:42,440
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

285
00:13:42,690 --> 00:13:45,780
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

286
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,230
♪At cultivation's peak♪

287
00:13:48,370 --> 00:13:52,210
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

288
00:13:52,620 --> 00:13:55,240
♪The sun and moon turn♪

289
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:58,930
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

290
00:13:59,390 --> 00:14:06,170
♪I am the undying flame♪

291
00:14:06,850 --> 00:14:11,570
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

292
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:15,100
♪At last I see, immortality♪

293
00:14:15,260 --> 00:14:19,900
♪Lives in your smiles♪
